# ==============================================================================
# Apna Community Health Clinic - Zero-Cost Gmail SMTP Configuration (Nodemailer)
# ==============================================================================
# Sends official appointment token slips, pharmacy notifications, and staff
# credentials directly to user emails completely free (up to 500 emails/day).
#
# 1. EMAIL_USER: Your full Gmail address (e.g. yourclinic@gmail.com)
# 2. EMAIL_APP_PASSWORD: 16-character Google App Password (not your normal password!)
#    Generate it in 30 seconds at: https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords
#    (Requires 2-Step Verification turned ON in your Google account)
#
# Copy this file to functions/.env.local (which is git-ignored and never committed):
EMAIL_USER=your_email@gmail.com
EMAIL_APP_PASSWORD=xxxx xxxx xxxx xxxx

